00:04:50.910 --> 00:04:52.910
Bagi Maya, pilihan itu muncul saat proses check-out.

00:04:53.390 --> 00:04:54.850
Di balik layar, bisnis perlu tahu persis

00:04:54.850 --> 00:04:56.950
